OL,3,GNEWSADad and daughter who dumped body
OL,4,Ain canal convicted
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disabled man and his daughter have
OL,7,Fbeen convicted after a sex worker was
OL,8,Fmurdered and her body was dumped in a
OL,9,Fcanal.
OL,11,FChereiss Bailey was found dead near a
OL,12,Fwaterway off Ryders Green Road in West
OL,13,FBromwich in October last year.
OL,15,FJohn Anslow, 65, assaulted Bailey in
OL,16,Fhis home, before he and his daughter,
OL,17,FHayley-Marie Ferguson, 42, moved her
OL,18,Fbody in a wheelchair and used a washing
OL,19,Fline with paving slabs attached, to
OL,20,Fsubmerge it in the water, police said.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
