OL,3,GNEWSADad and daughter who dumped body
OL,4,Ain canal convicted
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnslow had denied murder but was found
OL,7,Fguilty following a three-week trial at
OL,8,FBirmingham Crown Court. Ferguson was
OL,9,Ffound guilty of assisting an offender
OL,10,Fand preventing a lawful and decent
OL,11,Fburial, a charge Anslow had already
OL,12,Fpleaded guilty to.
